<title>PAKISTAN: ICI Pakistan offers high-yielding certificates.</title>
<headline>ICI Pakistan offers high-yielding certificates.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Pakistan is offering five-year Term Finance Certificates (TFCs) with promised interest of 18.70 percent payable semi-annually, the firm said in a prospectus published on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Banks will receive subscriptions for 750 million rupees TFCs from institutional investors and 250 million from the public on September 26, 29 and 30.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
